    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "After the actress was cast in Christopher Nolan's adaptation, the mob's orchestrated backlash erupted online. This social media conflict saw prominent commentators make a public accusation, a claim used to enforce conformity. Their criticism served as the manufactured pretext for an attack on the film production.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
