      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The allegations of erasing European history, a stated grievance from public figures, represent the claim used to enforce conformity. This cultural debate, however, met a counter-argument from the margins: the liberating reframing of tradition that diverse casting treats the Western canon as shared civilizational heritage.",
